    "  melee            1.00 with attack power 237   (a dragoon set, exactly)",
    "  physical ranged  1.20 with attack power 237   (a dancer set, exactly)",
    "  magical          1.30 with attack power 237   (a black mage set, exactly)",
    "",
    "The sim table confirms those independently: the damage per 100 potency it reports for casters",
    "against physical ranged is 1.0803, where the trait ratio is 1.0833. Different source, same answer."
